# Button / Section Contrast (BDR-0023)

Before adding or moving CTAs, read `sightline-brand-system/bdr/0023-section-surface-cta-contrast.md`.

## Rule

Filled buttons and section backgrounds **must not share the same resolved color**.

| Section bg | Primary CTA fill |
|---|---|
| `--c-ground` / alt | `--c-deep` (default `.btn-primary`) |
| `--c-deep` | `--c-ground` (cream) or `--c-signal` — use `.on-deep` ancestor or section-scoped override |
| `--c-ink` (footer) | links only; cream text tokens |

On deep sections, wrap CTAs in `.on-deep` or apply documented selectors — do not use default `.btn-primary` deep-green fill on deep-green sections.

Secondary links on deep: ground-alpha underline (not `--c-ink-muted`).

Log unresolved cases in `sightline-brand-system/spec/04-provenance-debt-log.md`.
